# Phase 3: Project Design Phase

## Project Title: EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

### 1. Introduction

The Project Design Phase focuses on designing the structure, interface, architecture, and workflow of the EduGenie application. It explains how the system will work and how different components interact with each other.

EduGenie is an AI-powered educational platform that uses Google Gemini API to help students understand academic topics, generate notes, summarize study materials, and prepare for examinations.

### 2. System Architecture

The system follows a three-layer architecture:

Presentation Layer

HTML, CSS, JavaScript

Student Interface / Chat Window

Application Layer

Python / Flask Backend

Request Processing and API Integration

AI Layer

Google Gemini API

Answer Generation, Notes and Summarization

