### 4. User Interface Design

The EduGenie application will contain the following screens:

Screen 1: Home Page

* EduGenie logo and project title

* Welcome message

* Start Learning button

* Navigation menu

Screen 2: AI Chatbot

* Question input box

* Send button

* AI-generated response area

* Clear chat option

Screen 3: Notes Generator

* Topic input field

* Generate Notes button

* Generated notes display

Screen 4: Exam Preparation

* Subject and topic selection

* Generate Questions button

* Practice questions and answers

