### 6. Technology Stack

* Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript

* Backend: Python Flask

* AI Integration: Google Gemini API

* Development Tool: Visual Studio Code

* Browser: Google Chrome

### 7. Expected Design Outcome

The design phase provides a clear blueprint for developing EduGenie. It defines the system architecture, modules, user interface, and communication between the frontend, backend, and Gemini AI.

### 8. Conclusion

The Project Design Phase establishes the complete structural and functional design of the EduGenie platform. This design will be used as the foundation for the next phase, Development and Implementation.
